    "title": "Bally Play Social Casino Games",
    "description": "Welcome to the new Bally Play! Your ultimate destination for endless entertainment! \r\n\r\nDive into the world of thrilling casino action right from your fingertips with the all NEW Bally Play! Download Bally Play and access a wide selection of all your casino favorites, including over 100 slots, video poker, blackjack, roulette, keno, bingo, and much more!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb0 100+ EXHILARATING SLOTS STRAIGHT FROM THE CASINO FLOOR:\r\n\r\n-          Play top favorites like IGT's Wheel of Fortune and Wolf Run Eclipse \r\n-          Enjoy AGS hits such as Rakin\u2019 Bacon & Fu Nan Fu Nu\r\n-          Explore Konami classics like China Shores, Gypsy Fire, Dragon Treasure Pearls, & Star Watch Jungle\r\n-          Experience Lightning Box excitement with 100x RA & Lightning Shenlong\r\n-          Embark on adventures with Aruze titles like Flaming Chillies & God of Atlantis\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udccf PLAY OVER 50+ FREE VIDEO POKER GAMES\r\n\r\n-          Dive into classic video poker games like Jokers Wild, Jacks or Better, Double Double Bonus Poker, and more!\r\n-          Try your hand at multi-play video poker for bigger jackpots, with options like Double Bonus Deuces Wild and Joker\u2019s Wild!\r\n-          Explore a variety of Multi-Rise Video Poker games, from Trio Joker\u2019s Wild to Jacks or Better and Trio Super Double Double Bonus Poker.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 EXPERIENCE CASINO CLASSICS\r\n\r\n-          Spin the wheel in Roulette or test your skills in Three Hand Blackjack, Blazing Bets Blackjack, or High Roller Blackjack!\r\n-          Enjoy the thrill of Bingo with up to four cards at once!\r\n-          Try your luck with exciting Keno titles like Count Dracula Keno, Lucky Cherry Keno, and Leprechaun Love Keno.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89 EARN FREE COINS\r\n\r\n-           Level up to unlock more slots and earn additional free coins!\r\n-           Play with friends to boost your luck and earn even more free coins!\r\n-           Grab Daily Bonuses and Bi-Hourly Bonuses to keep the excitement going!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 COMPETE IN DAILY QUESTS\r\n\r\n-          Complete daily quests to earn coins, win awesome prizes, or fill up your weekly progress bar!\r\n-          Fill your weekly progress bar for a chance to spin the 2X BONUS wheel!\r\n-          Discover new quests every day for endless fun!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 MORE FUN AND FEATURES\r\n\r\n-          Join the action in our interactive Link Lounge for more opportunities to win big!\r\n-          Stay updated with new slots and classic favorites featured every week!\r\n-          Become a VIP for exclusive access to new slots, bonuses, and benefits!\r\n\r\nLike Bally Play on Facebook for even  more chances at free coins\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/BallyPlaySocial/\r\nWild-Tiles and Gems Wild-Tiles are trademarks of Case Venture Management, LLC.\r\nMulti-Rise Video Poker\u2122 is a trademark of Oddworks.\r\n\r\nView our privacy policy at: https://www.ballyplay.com/privacy-policy/\r\n \r\nView our Terms of service at: https://www.ballyplay.com/terms-of-service/\r\n\r\nThis product is for players 18 years or older for entertainment purposes only. The games are intended for an adult audience. The games do not offer \"\"real money gambling\"\" or an opportunity to win real money or prizes.  Practice or success at social casino gaming does not imply future success at \"real money gambling\".  No purchase necessary.\r\n\r\nDo not sell my data: Bally Play shares your personal information with advertising partners to personalize ads. Learn more at https://www.ballyplay.com/privacy-policy/. If you wish to exercise your Do Not Sell My Data rights, you can do so by contacting us via the in-game help centre or by emailing support@ballyplay.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the new Bally Play! Your ultimate destination for endless entertainment! <br><br>Dive into the world of thrilling casino action right from your fingertips with the all NEW Bally Play! Download Bally Play and access a wide selection of all your casino favorites, including over 100 slots, video poker, blackjack, roulette, keno, bingo, and much more!<br><br>\ud83c\udfb0 100+ EXHILARATING SLOTS STRAIGHT FROM THE CASINO FLOOR:<br><br>-          Play top favorites like IGT&#39;s Wheel of Fortune and Wolf Run Eclipse <br>-          Enjoy AGS hits such as Rakin\u2019 Bacon &amp; Fu Nan Fu Nu<br>-          Explore Konami classics like China Shores, Gypsy Fire, Dragon Treasure Pearls, &amp; Star Watch Jungle<br>-          Experience Lightning Box excitement with 100x RA &amp; Lightning Shenlong<br>-          Embark on adventures with Aruze titles like Flaming Chillies &amp; God of Atlantis<br><br>\ud83c\udccf PLAY OVER 50+ FREE VIDEO POKER GAMES<br><br>-          Dive into classic video poker games like Jokers Wild, Jacks or Better, Double Double Bonus Poker, and more!<br>-          Try your hand at multi-play video poker for bigger jackpots, with options like Double Bonus Deuces Wild and Joker\u2019s Wild!<br>-          Explore a variety of Multi-Rise Video Poker games, from Trio Joker\u2019s Wild to Jacks or Better and Trio Super Double Double Bonus Poker.<br><br>\ud83c\udfb2 EXPERIENCE CASINO CLASSICS<br><br>-          Spin the wheel in Roulette or test your skills in Three Hand Blackjack, Blazing Bets Blackjack, or High Roller Blackjack!<br>-          Enjoy the thrill of Bingo with up to four cards at once!<br>-          Try your luck with exciting Keno titles like Count Dracula Keno, Lucky Cherry Keno, and Leprechaun Love Keno.<br><br>\ud83c\udf89 EARN FREE COINS<br><br>-           Level up to unlock more slots and earn additional free coins!<br>-           Play with friends to boost your luck and earn even more free coins!<br>-        